e": 3692.63, "timestamp": "01:01:32", "text": "つまり、そう、それがJとしての私の旅路です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3694.789, "timestamp": "01:01:34", "text": "次に与える"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3698.492, "timestamp": "01:01:38", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and niku is niku"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3699.349, "timestamp": "01:01:39", "text": "つまり、ヤク焼き鳥を安く済ませる人もいるということだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3700.27, "timestamp": "01:01:40", "text": "ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3718.91, "timestamp": "01:01:58", "text": "知ってるでしょ、私はうちのチキンしか食べたことがないの"}]